      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "レティアさんに呼びされた僕は、\n薄暗い森の中へとやってきていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "920ccce8b2b7de831edb7c64ea797a03f4439be68f3bc8cbef27776b6e6fa18d",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "地図だとこの辺りで間違いなさそうだけど……。\n……うわっ！？　これは……？",
      "jp_sha256": "18e71bae63e65bd817fc68859cf96e56f4b6c34de13cb9ab90aad4fe07702ae2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "지도대로라면 이 근처가 틀림없을 텐데…….\n……우왓!? 이건……?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
