      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "広場の中心に立っていたレティアさんが、僕を手招きする。\n僕は言われるがまま、彼女の方へと歩いていった。",
      "jp_sha256": "50a1977eef90606c8b5c24e39382fe26dd069e194bbe18a6a8d5de2be95f28b2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "광장 한가운데 서 있던 레티아 씨가 나를 손짓해 불렀다.\n나는 시키는 대로 그녀에게 걸어갔다.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "7591dffdba224ef54a1fc5c6fe4ce3d6e0e4907e499c92ad6a17616080215bc4:000000_-8513998060070046391:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "広場の中心に立っていたレティアさんが、僕を手招きする。\n僕は言われるがまま、彼女の方へと歩いていった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "078270972ea7160c921bb9ef21ffda41dcc883839a89db3a413bcc68e4e3b879",
