    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d70add150dfa9aa05fce0d4b6317487e3b78eddd8da465462a8ce4ea3cf5460c",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "えぇぇっ！？　ち、ちょっと待ってください！\n僕は普通の人間なんですよ？\nモンスター娘の皆さんと同じようには戦えませんって！",
      "jp_sha256": "fe71e192a7b93b96d37809432f746c08bf0d8b3ee1f9b5ea45e9ec3b222b7079",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "에에엣!? 자, 잠깐만요!\n저는 평범한 인간이라고요?\n몬스터 소녀 여러분처럼 싸울 수는 없다니까요!",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "7591dffdba224ef54a1fc5c6fe4ce3d6e0e4907e499c92ad6a17616080215bc4:000000_-8513998060070046391:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "えぇぇっ！？　ち、ちょっと待ってください！\n僕は普通の人間なんですよ？\nモンスター娘の皆さんと同じようには戦えませんって！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "2b122290116c3fd9d06ca448f19f8925857dcd717e7e39a83b058f1e5eda3fb8",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "はぁ……そんなことは百も承知だ。\n我々と同じ力を持てと誰が言った？\nそんなことは最初から期待していない。",
      "jp_sha256": "3d77f416c791518231a951daf302ec5f9fca3ab3e9fb76481f0f420a862a281f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하아…… 그런 건 나도 잘 안다.\n우리와 같은 힘을 가지라고 누가 말했지?\n그런 건 처음부터 기대하지 않았다.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 30,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
